Package: scwbStatistics
Type: Package
Title: Statistical Operations for scworkbench
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Hendrik A.", "de Weerd", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "dirkdeweerd.work@gmail.com")
Description: Explicitly activated operation-pack ABI v2 implementations of
    terminal differential, marker, association, comparison, and feature-trend
    statistics for scworkbench. Installation is inert; scworkbench remains the
    sole owner of bundle state, staging, publication, and provenance.
